Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Ask Blaaiz to replay one transaction webhook
POST {{KorridorX_HostAddress}}/api/admin/providers/transactions/{{providerTransactionRowId}}/webhook-replay
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

